							<div class="text-7xl">🍽️</div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-8">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-construction-dark mb-4">
								Restaurant Build-Outs
							</h2>
							<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
								Fast-casual and QSR construction expertise. We know the tight timelines and
								specialized requirements of restaurant construction.
							</p>
							<h3 class="font-semibold text-construction-dark mb-3">Specialties:</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">QSR ground-up construction</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Tenant improvement projects</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Kitchen equipment installation</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
