								so your commercial project starts on solid ground.
							</p>
							<h3 class="font-semibold text-construction-dark mb-3">Services Include:</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Site clearing and grading</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Foundation excavation</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Utility installation and trenching</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Drainage and erosion control</span>
								</li>
							</ul>
							<a href="/contact" class="block text-center px-6 py-3 bg-construction-primary text-white rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-600 hover:scale-105 transition-all">
								Learn More
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</FadeInSection>

				<!-- Retail & Strip Centers -->
				<FadeInSection client:load delay={0.5}>
					<div id="retail" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-2xl transition-shadow border-2 border-construction-primary/20 hover:border-construction-primary">
						<div class="h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600 to-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center">
							<div class="text-7xl">🏬</div>
						</div>
						<div class="p-8">
							<h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-construction-dark mb-4">
								Retail & Strip Centers
							</h2>
							<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
								Ground-up construction and tenant improvements for retail developments.
								We build the spaces that drive commerce.
							</p>
							<h3 class="font-semibold text-construction-dark mb-3">Capabilities:</h3>
							<ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Strip mall construction</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
									</svg>
									<span class="text-gray-700">Tenant build-outs</span>
								</li>
								<li class="flex items-start">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-construction-primary mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
										<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
